    "title": "A=1 quadratic squarefree shared-correction third-jet vanishing",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "unconditional extension of the cubic quotient through squarefree shared roots",
    "statement": "At a squarefree root shared by g_* and S_B, the specialized regular symmetric Hankel block has corank one and determinant order three. The shared gate gives M u=z^2 kappa_tau nu(x_*)+O(z^3). A symmetric Schur-complement lemma forces u^T M u to have order at least three, while its z^2 coefficient is kappa_tau U_tau(x_*). The padded root x_* is simple, so U_tau(x_*) is nonzero and kappa_tau=0. Hence D_1 divides every divided-row moment, the cubic recurrence extends, and the local Smith type is [3].",
